# Eval reports are run OUTPUT: one file per `pnpm eval:harness` invocation,
# against whatever endpoint happened to be up. Tracking every ad-hoc run would
# make the directory unreadable within a week. The README stays, and the
# reference runs that a PR argues from are added explicitly with `git add -f`.
evals/reports/*
!evals/reports/README.md
